  "problem": "Missed-work choices wrote immediately without a durable preview or exact Retry. Reordering rewrote settled occurrence times and left already-generated future rows behind rule hours.",
  "concept": {
    "file": "scheduling-preparation/scheduling-concept.html",
    "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8883/build/ux-context/runs/scheduling-preparation/scheduling-concept.html",
