  },
  "decision": "Retain weekly Plan/date-only Home semantics and accessible ordering. One schedule-owned private proposal retains the exact week, baseline and policy result. Confirm records an immutable command before mutation; changed/unavailable data never authorizes replay.",
  "behavior": [
    "Read-only transactional previews; frozen dates/IDs and expected rules/occurrences compared in the commit transaction.",
    "Private typed schedule checkpoint, synchronous UI reservation, maintenance/restore guard, generation/version/visit fencing and exact readback.",
    "Back/Close keeps the durable proposal. Reopening identifies it without opening a form or applying it. Explicit Discard changes only private work.",
    "Conflict requires explicit fresh review, which retains the old proposal until a replacement is readable; another Confirm remains necessary.",
    "Home and Plan share the private owner and render normal, checking, failure, unavailable and recovery states with one primary action.",
    "Planned rows and generated future rows follow ordering; settled rows retain their exact saved values. Completed rows expose no reorder controls.",
    "Scope/reminder consequences and affected routine-deletion weekdays are explicit. Existing illustrations, routine management and navigation remain.",
    "Targeted shrinker retention preserves reflected private checkpoint fields across build variants; no Room/public/backup-format change."
  ],
